Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.46,0:00:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First element.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.46,0:00:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.22,0:00:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for some reason there was a lack\Nof spatial power and we couldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,conjure our incineration projectiles\Nand then the enemy launched
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.58,0:00:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a large-scale attack 90 of the\Ndemi-human unit 70 % of the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ogre archers and over 30% of the\Ndark mage unit were destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.62,0:00:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For some reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.94,0:00:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you dense?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.14,0:00:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone used a massive formal art and\Ndrained all the spatial power in the ravine!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.40,0:00:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how can that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.80,0:00:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even conjure\Na spell of that scale!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.88,0:00:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do they have that is that powerful?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.84,0:01:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you where I want.
