Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.18,0:02:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,retreated.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.09,0:02:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guided us to victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.60,0:03:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Fanatio.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.82,0:03:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This battle is far from being over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.10,0:03:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More sacred power has\Ncollected in the ravine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.24,0:03:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must consume it with healing\Narts before the enemy can absorb
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.40,0:03:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.31,0:03:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time is short, and we have yet to face\Ntheir dark knights and pugilists. True.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.84,0:03:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All who are able, take the\Nwounded and fall back! Priests,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.94,0:03:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,focus on healing until\Nall the spatial power has
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.48,0:03:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,been Depleted and keep\Nwatch for enemy movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.68,0:03:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will go and give my report to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.44,0:03:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The commander will you be all right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.98,0:03:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could not have
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.80,0:03:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,succeeded without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.46,0:03:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amayori, eat your fill and get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.88,0:03:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've earned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.26,0:03:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Milady.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.06,0:04:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Altar, have you been injured?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.14,0:04:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, nothing major at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.74,0:04:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I'm being honest, I\Nwould have preferred to perish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.46,0:04:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of talk is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.50,0:04:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your troops look up to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.20,0:04:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you have a duty to lead\Nthem and fight to the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.48,0:04:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, as a leader, I have failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.80,0:04:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only did the goblins breach my ranks,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.90,0:04:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their commander was felled by Ser Renly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.06,0:04:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How humiliating!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.02,0:04:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I betrayed your teachings\Nand your expectations of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.76,0:04:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to think I could be worthy\Nof her heart, her love.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.26,0:04:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How laughable!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.26,0:04:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do not have the right to\Ncall myself your disciple!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.52,0:04:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.50,0:04:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you did all you could.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.70,0:04:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you not see how\Nmuch everyone needs you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.14,0:04:54.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The troops under your\Ncommand, the citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.26,0:04:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, too, as a matter of fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.12,0:04:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.56,0:05:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For my strength on the battlefield?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.78,0:05:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.56,0:05:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.96,0:05:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What business do you have here unarmed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.50,0:05:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your life is almost at its end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.04,0:05:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I be Furgur.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.38,0:05:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I be chief of all Ogre.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.90,0:05:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep up your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.38,0:05:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is one of their Council of Ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.70,0:05:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.62,0:05:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Light and fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.62,0:05:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You conjure. Unleash.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.80,0:05:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your power. Your luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.08,0:05:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You be Priestess of Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.46,0:05:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If take back with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.26,0:05:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,End of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.24,0:05:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ogre, return to planes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.48,0:05:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Priestess?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.39,0:05:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,End of war?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.46,0:05:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who told you this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.34,0:05:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on now, speak up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.78,0:06:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,M 'lady, this fiend is obviously stolen!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.48,0:06:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, M 'lady, he lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.48,0:06:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you say, I am the Priestess of Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.78,0:06:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, before I go anywhere with you,\NI wish to know who it is that seeks me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.82,0:06:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emperor Vector.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.14,0:06:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He say, find priestess of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.94,0:06:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He grant wish to who\Ncatch and bring to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.58,0:06:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, ogre can go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.34,0:06:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise horses, hunt bird, and live.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.46,0:06:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely you must despise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.74,0:06:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you not wish to avenge your people?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.20,0:06:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.16,0:06:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Burden of strong, heavy as they be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.02,0:06:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I chief my burden to protect kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.38,0:06:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is why I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I catch you and take back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.40,0:07:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May your soul return home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back to the plains.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.86,0:07:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emperor Vecta.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.96,0:07:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the reason your strategy failed\Nand a thousand dark mages died?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.34,0:07:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was because the enemy absorbed all\Nthe spatial power before you could.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.24,0:07:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I understand that correctly? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.62,0:07:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.72,0:07:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear we had no idea they had\Nsomeone who could cast such an art!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.38,0:08:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only the Pontifex, and she is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.34,0:08:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there some other way\Nto replenish this power?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.26,0:08:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.46,0:08:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,using spatial resources such\Nas rich land and sunlight,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.46,0:08:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but to generate enough\Npower to destroy the enemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.48,0:08:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we would need ample amounts, and\Nunfortunately, there is little here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.04,0:08:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.95,0:08:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, I see no grass or trees at\Nall, and the sun set a while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.64,0:08:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So tell me, what were you going to use\Nas a power source for your attack spell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.36,0:08:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, each life has power, and during the\Nassault, as warriors from both sides died,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.30,0:08:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their expired lives filled the\Nair with spatial power. Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.36,0:08:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blood and life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.82,0:08:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,D .I .L.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.44,0:08:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would 3,000 be sufficient? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.00,0:09:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.98,0:09:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.66,0:09:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Priestess of Light?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.68,0:09:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.72,0:09:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do not recall reading about this\Nperson in any of the history books,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.64,0:09:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but whoever she may be, the emperor\Nof the Dark Territory is after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.04,0:09:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This emperor is the dark god Vecta, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.64,0:09:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A god walking among us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.56,0:09:46.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I find that hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.58,0:09:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.92,0:09:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's say Vekta's back and running\Nthings in the Dark Territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.38,0:09:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If what the ogre said's\Ntrue and Vekta's looking
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.00,0:09:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for this priestess of light\Nand he thinks you're it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.52,0:10:00.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's that going to affect\Nwhere this war goes from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.34,0:10:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The five tribes want the\Nresources of the human empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.00,0:10:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, Vecta just wants\Nthe Priestess of Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.72,0:10:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.20,0:10:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall enter the Dark Territory,\Nthen make my way to the edge of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.66,0:10:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the Priestess of Light\Nis what Vecta wants,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.72,0:10:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then he will come after\Nme with most of his army.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.36,0:10:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The troops he leaves behind\Nwill be without leadership,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.82,0:10:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you can wipe them out in the chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.32,0:10:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, I shall make my way\Nto the World's End Altar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.48,0:10:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, once we're off the line,\NI'll crank the FLA to a thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.68,0:10:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, take Alice and head\Nto the World's End Altar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.78,0:10:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never heard of that place!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.84,0:10:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.94,0:10:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just go out the eastern gate\Nand the altar's due south!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.08,0:10:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps, if I go there...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.34,0:10:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, but I'm sending a third\Nof our troops along with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.04,0:10:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uncle, you cannot spare that\Nmany just for my escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.16,0:11:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy has more than 30,000 left.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.50,0:11:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not all going to chase you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.60,0:11:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially if you're the\Nonly one running around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the plan is to get\Nthem to split their ranks,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.86,0:11:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we got to give them a\Nbig enough reason to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.64,0:11:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.46,0:11:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got one more condition for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.48,0:11:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.48,0:11:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way you're doing\Nthis is if I come along.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.50,0:11:31.67,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fs62\c&HF5F4F6&\fnQuadraat-Bold\blur0.7\pos(968.847,887.867)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,120,\alpha&H00&)\t(2524,2644,\alpha&HFF&)}D{\alpha&HFF&\t(14,134,\alpha&H00&)\t(2543,2663,\alpha&HFF&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(29,149,\alpha&H00&)\t(2562,2682,\alpha&HFF&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(44,164,\alpha&H00&)\t(2582,2702,\alpha&HFF&)}k {\alpha&HFF&\t(59,179,\alpha&H00&)\t(2601,2721,\alpha&HFF&)}T{\alpha&HFF&\t(74,194,\alpha&H00&)\t(2621,2741,\alpha&HFF&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(89,209,\alpha&H00&)\t(2640,2760,\alpha&HFF&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(104,224,\alpha&H00&)\t(2660,2780,\alpha&HFF&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(119,239,\alpha&H00&)\t(2679,2799,\alpha&HFF&)}i{\alpha&HFF&\t(134,254,\alpha&H00&)\t(2699,2819,\alpha&HFF&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(148,268,\alpha&H00&)\t(2718,2838,\alpha&HFF&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(163,283,\alpha&H00&)\t(2738,2858,\alpha&HFF&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(178,298,\alpha&H00&)\t(2757,2877,\alpha&HFF&)}y {\alpha&HFF&\t(193,313,\alpha&H00&)\t(2777,2897,\alpha&HFF&)}- {\alpha&HFF&\t(208,328,\alpha&H00&)\t(2796,2916,\alpha&HFF&)}O{\alpha&HFF&\t(223,343,\alpha&H00&)\t(2816,2936,\alpha&HFF&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(238,358,\alpha&H00&)\t(2835,2955,\alpha&HFF&)}c {\alpha&HFF&\t(253,373,\alpha&H00&)\t(2855,2975,\alpha&HFF&)}T{\alpha&HFF&\t(268,388,\alpha&H00&)\t(2874,2994,\alpha&HFF&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(282,402,\alpha&H00&)\t(2894,3014,\alpha&HFF&)}i{\alpha&HFF&\t(297,417,\alpha&H00&)\t(2913,3033,\alpha&HFF&)}b{\alpha&HFF&\t(312,432,\alpha&H00&)\t(2933,3053,\alpha&HFF&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(327,447,\alpha&H00&)\t(2952,3072,\alpha&HFF&)}'{\alpha&HFF&\t(342,462,\alpha&H00&)\t(2972,3092,\alpha&HFF&)}s {\alpha&HFF&\t(357,477,\alpha&H00&)\t(2991,3111,\alpha&HFF&)}C{\alpha&HFF&\t(372,492,\alpha&H00&)\t(3011,3131,\alpha&HFF&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(387,507,\alpha&H00&)\t(3030,3150,\alpha&HFF&)}m{\alpha&HFF&\t(402,522,\alpha&H00&)\t(3050,3170,\alpha&HFF&)}p
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.06,0:11:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Orc Chief Lil Pelham,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.64,0:11:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you will offer 3,000 lives so that my\Ndark mages can launch their attack spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.16,0:11:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't do that to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.12,0:11:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My tribe are warriors and\Nwe came here to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.22,0:11:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and your people failed, so why do\Nwe have to pay for that with our lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.12,0:11:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an order from the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.14,0:11:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lil, we have no choice except\Nto obey His Majesty's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.66,0:11:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd lend you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.72,0:12:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he needs three thousand of our\Ntroops, I'll offer my life and my clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.66,0:12:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do it for him and\Nfor the honor of the orc.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.74,0:12:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lil, you know what I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.36,0:12:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All souls go to heaven,\Nbe it human or orc.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.72,0:12:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we die, we go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.54,0:12:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's where I'll be waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.48,0:12:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, Len. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.82,0:12:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.82,0:12:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.46,0:12:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will assemble your troops\N100 mils from the ravine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.54,0:12:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,3,000, not one less.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.82,0:12:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.74,0:12:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right. Move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.68,0:13:03.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Helltree.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.92,0:13:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our goal is to split the enemy forces\Nand destroy the group that follows us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.74,0:13:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After we pass through the\NEastern Gate, the Guard Unit,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.08,0:13:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Priest Unit, and the\NSupply Corps will head south.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.94,0:13:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the terrain is favorable,\Nthe troops will take position.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.06,0:13:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until then, we knights\Nwill act as a diversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.70,0:13:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Return to your positions,\Nand prepare for battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.02,0:13:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.96,0:13:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,transfer human unit\Ndurability, area to south,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.86,0:14:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Generate Umbral Element.\NForm Element, Worm Shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.28,0:14:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long live to your tribe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.12,0:14:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glory be to the earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.62,0:14:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lentu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.64,0:14:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.06,0:14:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.78,0:14:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curse on every one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.82,0:15:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be. They are chanting a sacred\Nart. Uncle, I used all the spatial.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.04,0:15:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,resources here there should not be enough\Nleft to carry out a large-scale art
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.74,0:15:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there is they're making it
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.32,0:15:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what incredible power how magnificent
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.70,0:15:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just got word from our spotters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.38,0:15:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are Integrity Knights approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.64,0:15:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This Deathworm attack spell can't\Nbe blocked by sword or armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.36,0:15:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those damned Integrity Knights\Nwill be devoured alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.62,0:15:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.38,0:15:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let them get closer. Hold. Hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.36,0:16:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.14,0:16:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna lure him away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.62,0:16:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.14,0:16:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it! No, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.44,0:16:22.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your sword won't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.58,0:16:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huuuuhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.04,0:16:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eldrie!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.80,0:16:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Eldrie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.86,0:16:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Divine serpent of yore, if you\Nare truly the king of snakes,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.86,0:16:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then you should have no trouble\Ndevouring this pack of earthworms!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.04,0:16:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Release Recollection!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.40,0:17:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way, you disgusting things!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.34,0:17:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.66,0:17:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.57,0:17:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall not give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.12,0:17:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.76,0:18:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Alice...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.08,0:18:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Albrea!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.12,0:18:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.44,0:18:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eldrie! Eldrie!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.00,0:18:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, open your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.98,0:18:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.89,0:18:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cannot leave me, not\Nlike this, do you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.70,0:18:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're safe, m'lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.68,0:18:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes I am, thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.64,0:19:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go. I meant it\Nwhen I said I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.82,0:19:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not cry, m 'lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.02,0:19:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must think of those who need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.20,0:19:11.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are all that matter now, not I.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.26,0:19:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have behaved so selfishly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.86,0:19:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I could have you all to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.48,0:19:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That does not matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.60,0:19:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.60,0:19:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are my disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.24,0:19:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will give you whatever you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.54,0:19:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I have all that I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.40,0:19:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paltrier! Paltrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.64,0:19:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.26,0:19:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mug...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.50,0:19:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Furn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.06,0:20:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eldrie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.84,0:20:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear to you, they shall\Npay for what they've done!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.58,0:20:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amayori, Takiguri, charge the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.68,0:20:31.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.74,0:20:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.94,0:20:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At that priority level,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.50,0:20:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Death Worms should\Nhave easily devoured
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.18,0:20:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Integrity Knights\Nand the ground troops!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.62,0:20:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of art did\Nthose rotten humans use?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.06,0:20:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.97,0:20:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, fall back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.04,0:20:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Burn them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.20,0:20:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Burn them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.62,0:21:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enhance armament.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.64,0:21:15.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.55,0:21:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.72,0:21:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not here, not like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.58,0:21:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be the empress!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.50,0:21:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to become\Nthe ruler of this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.02,0:21:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My lady, we've done nothing wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.86,0:21:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System called!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.92,0:21:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Alice, Integrity Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.16,0:21:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice Synthesis 30!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.40,0:21:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the proxy of the three\Ngoddesses who protect this realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.16,0:21:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the Priestess of Light,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.14,0:21:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and whoever dares defy me shall\Nknow the fury of my power!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.60,0:22:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.24,0:22:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alicia...
Dialogue: 4,0:22:06.20,0:22:10.72,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.5\c&HF9FEFE&}"I'll be fine even if you're gone"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.48,0:22:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The light is still alive.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:10.72,0:22:13.73,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\blur0.5\c&H241B10&}"I'll be fine even if you're gone"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.90,0:22:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every day like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.08,0:22:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm making it.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:13.73,0:22:17.85,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.5\c&H241B10&}An empty assurance escapes my lips again
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.92,0:22:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all my strength.
